# Excluded from the EAS build upload.
#
# EAS archives the git repository root, not this directory, so these rules
# are matched at any depth and must not start with a slash.
#
# Keep this file LF. A rule whose line ends in a carriage return does not
# match anything, which is how a 709 MB node_modules tree ends up in the
# upload while this file says it does not. ``.gitattributes`` pins the
# checkout to LF for that reason.
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
android/
ios/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.app

# Sibling applications are not part of a mobile build.
client/
server/
docs/
showcase/

# Local environment. EAS reads its values from the build profile or the
# EAS environment, never from a checked-out .env.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local tooling state.
.agents/
skills-lock.json
coverage/
*.log
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*

# OS / editor noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.pem
